<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <h2 class="title">Why Choose Latvia?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Quality Education: Learn from Leading Institutions
                            <p class="fs-5">The Latvia institutions are celebrated for their academic standards and diverse range of programs. A recognized education system—with no language barriers.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Affordable Tuition: Value for Investment
                            <p class="fs-5">Latvia offers high-quality education at a fraction of the cost compared to many other European countries. Tuition fees are generally lower, and there are plenty of scholarships available.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Low Cost of Living: Enjoy Europe on a Budget
                            <p class="fs-5">Affordable accommodation, reasonably priced food, and accessible transportation make it easy to live as a student. Living well in Europe doesn’t have to come with a hefty price tag.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Rich Cultural Heritage: Tradition and Modernity
                            <p class="fs-5">Latvia’s cultural landscape is a vibrant mix of old and new. Explore the medieval charm of Riga’s Old Town, dive into lively arts and music scenes, and join in on traditional festivals.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Strategic Location: Gateway to Europe
                            <p class="fs-5">
                                Located in Northern Europe, Latvia is perfectly positioned for travel adventures. With its efficient transportation network, you can easily explore both Eastern and Western Europe.
                            </p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Welcoming International Community
                            <p class="fs-5">Latvian universities foster a warm, inclusive environment, attracting students from all over the world. This atmosphere encourages cultural exchange and global networking.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Innovative Research: Get Involved in Different Projects
                            <p class="fs-5">Latvia is committed to research and innovation. Universities often collaborate with industries, offering students hands-on opportunities to participate in cutting-edge projects.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            English-Taught Programs: Study in Your Preferred Language
                            <p class="fs-5">Many Latvian universities provide a wide selection of programs taught in English, covering various academic fields. This ensures a smooth transition for international students.</p>
                        </li>

                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <img src="~/assets/images/latvia/latvia-2.jpg" style="border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 10px #3a397d54;" alt="Study Abroad Latvia" title="Study Abroad Latvia" loading="lazy">
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>



